\\\\"}}\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/streams/003-quick-fix.stdout.log:141:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_75\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"Aligned accepted user-response finalization on the durable `historyItemId`, so the bridge path and direct response path now converge on the same canonical archive key instead of `clientRequestId` vs `historyItemId`. The key changes are in [process-history-compat.service.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/archive/process-history-compat.service.ts), [process-response.service.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-response.service.ts), and the Story 2 regression coverage in [archive-finalization.test.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts). I also updated the live/archive separation proofs in the designated live-surface tests: [process-live.test.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/client/process-live.test.ts) and [process-live-updates.test.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts). Biome formatting is clean, including the touched archive fixture in [archive.ts](/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/tests/fixtures/archive.ts).\\n\\nVerification passed with:\\n- `corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/archive-finalization.test.ts`\\n- `corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/client/process-live.test.ts tests/service/server/process-live-updates.test.ts`\\n- `corepack pnpm run green-verify`\\n\\nAssumption used: the canonical accepted-response identity should be the finalized history item, not the transient `clientRequestId`, because that is the only durable identifier shared by both bridge-first and direct-finalization flows.\"}}\ndocs/spec-bu