acts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:7:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Implementation reports ready-for-verification with targeted tests, story gate, and epic gate passing, but there is not yet a verifier result. The smallest safe next action is independent verification focused on Story 2 acceptance and the required non-TC separation checks.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/003-implementor.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b plus the two Story 2 non-TC decided tests: live history upserts do not create archive rows, and appendFromProcessHistoryItem maps only finalized compatible items. Also check that the implementation does not replace live WebSocket/upsert transport or archive raw deltas/interrupted partial objects.\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After verifier returns, accept only if final verifier outcome is pass with no open findings and evidence covers TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b plus live/archive separation and compatibility mapping.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-quick-fix\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest verifier result is revise with one blocking quick-fix finding: bridged user_message compatibility rows can use a different finalizationKey than the accepted-response path and duplicate archive truth. The smallest safe next action is to remediate that specific idempotency-key mismatch before re-verification.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"findingRefs\\\":[\\\"story2-user-message-bridge-finalization-key\\\"],\\\"remediationGoal\\\":\\\"Make the process-history compatibility bridge for finalized user_message entries reuse the same accepted-response finalizationKey as ProcessResponseService, or otherwise prevent bridged accepted responses from creating duplicate canonical archive entries. Add or update focused service tests proving a response archived through respond() is not duplicated by appendFromProcessHistoryItem on the same history item.\\\",\\\"workingDirectory\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After quick-fix returns, run verification focused on the fixed user_message bridge finalizationKey finding plus TC-2.3b and compatibility mapping evidence before considering accept-story.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:15:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest bounded child response is a quick-fix marked ready-for-verification after a blocking verifier finding. Acceptance is not allowed until a final verifier pass confirms the fix and required Story 2 evidence, so the smallest safe next action is targeted re-verification.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/002-quick-fix.json\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/005-verify.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify the quick-fix resolved story2-user-message-bridge-finalization-key, with focused evidence for TC-2.3b exact-once retry behavior and compatibility mapping, while confirming no new Story 2 regressions.\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After this verifier returns, accept only if outcome is pass, no open findings remain, Story 2 coverage includes TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b plus live/archive separation and compatibility mapping, and the configured story gate passed.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:19:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-quick-fix\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest verifier outcome is revise with three blocking open findings, and all are marked quick-fix scope. Acceptance is not allowed until the duplicate user-message bridge path is fixed, live/archive separation coverage is added, formatting is corrected, and a later verifier pass confirms the story gate.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"findingRefs\\\":[\\\"story2-user-message-bridge-key-mismatch\\\",\\\"story2-green-verify-format-failure\\\",\\\"story2-live-archive-separation-proof-missing\\\"],\\\"remediationGoal\\\":\\\"Fix Story 2 verifier findings by preventing bridge-first accepted user responses from creating duplicate canonical archive entries, adding required live/archive separation test coverage in the designated live surface tests, correcting Biome formatting, and running focused tests plus corepack pnpm run green-verify.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After quick-fix returns, run verification focused on all three latest findings: user_message bridge duplicate prevention, live/archive separation coverage, Biome format/story gate, and full Story 2 TC coverage before considering accept-story.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:23:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest quick-fix reports ready-for-verification after the prior verifier left three blocking findings. Acceptance is not allowed until a verifier confirms the duplicate user-message bridge path, live/archive separation coverage, formatting/story gate, and full Story 2 test coverage are all resolved.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/003-quick-fix.json\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/008-verify.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify the latest quick-fix against all open findings from 008-verify: bridge-first and response-first user_message duplicate prevention, required live/archive separation coverage, Biome format/story gate, TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b, compatibility mapping, and configured story gate `corepack pnpm run green-verify`. Recommend pass only if no open findings remain.\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After verifier returns, accept only if outcome is pass, no open findings remain, Story 2 coverage includes TC-2.1a through TC-2.3b plus live/archive separation and compatibility mapping, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` passed.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/02-finalization-boundary-between-live-state-and-archive/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:27:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-quick-fix\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest verifier result is revise with one blocking production-path finding: execution-result archive rows are finalized from transient provider payload IDs instead of the persisted process-history rows. Acceptance is not allowed, and the smallest safe next step is a bounded same-session fix for that specific identity mismatch plus its test coverage.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"findingRefs\\\":[\\\"story-02-history-bridge-identity-mismatch\\\"],\\\"remediationGoal\\\":\\\"Fix the execution-result finalization hook so archive entries bridged from finalized execution history use the persisted processHistoryItems row identity returned by appendProcessHistoryItem, not the transient provider payload identity. Update Story 2 tests so TC-2.3a/TC-2.3b prove the archive entry sourceObjectId/finalizationKey align with the stored history row and replayed completions do not duplicate canonical entries. Keep raw delta/interrupted exclusions, user-response idempotency, live/archive separation coverage, and existing compatibility mapping behavior intact.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After quick-fix returns, run verification focused on story-02-history-bridge-identity-mismatch, especially persisted history-row identity in execution-result finalization, TC-2.3a/TC-2.3b exact-once behavior, and green-verify before considering accept-story.\\\"}\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
